    "detailed_description": "<strong>Toys </strong>come to life to engage in epic battles!<br><br>A unique 2D fighting game, skillfully blending elements of &quot;<strong>Smash Bros</strong>&quot; and &quot;<strong>Mario Odyssey</strong>&quot;. Skillfully transfer the soul of your characters and gain advantage by creating the best possible synergies.<br><br>The heart of the game lies in its &quot;<strong>body transmission</strong>&quot; system. Combine this with its variety of <strong>characters </strong>with diverse personalities and skills, and deep strategic depth and endless possibilities are offered for epic battles.<br><br>With its aesthetic charm, &quot;Toys Cracker&quot; is the perfect game for players of all ages. Dive into this wonderful world and get ready to experience unforgettable battles, where imagination becomes reality!",
